        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9145, Vintage Collection Irena Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis octagon-shaped Irena Cabinet Knob is available in 3 vintage finishes, all of which mimic the texture of naturally weathered metal. Made of solid brass, this cabinet knob will be sure to add a lavish embellishment to any home. The old world look of the available finishes makes the Irena Vintage Finish Cabinet Knob a great choice for historic homes and restoration projects. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available other <a href=\"/collections/omnia-cabinet-hardware\"><b>Omnia Vintage Collection Cabinet Knobs</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 9145 Irena Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9145/25</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9145/30</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9145/40</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
